The school prospectus for the **2026/27 IB Diploma Programme** is now available. It introduces Private Bilingual High School Česká 10 in Bratislava, the two study pathways we offer, and what the Diploma Programme looks like in practice here.

All four pages are shown below and can be read in order.

## Page 1: The school and the bilingual programme

An introduction to the school, its two complementary study pathways, and the bilingual programme, together with key facts about the Diploma Programme at Česká.

![Prospectus page 1: introduction to Private Bilingual High School Česká 10, the bilingual programme, and key facts about the Diploma Programme](/images/news/prospectus-2026-27-p1.webp)

## Page 2: The IB Diploma Programme and the MYP

What the Diploma Programme sets out to develop, the six subject groups with TOK, the Extended Essay and CAS, and the school's work towards authorisation for the IB Middle Years Programme.

![Prospectus page 2: the aims of the IB Diploma Programme, its core elements, and the school's plans for the Middle Years Programme](/images/news/prospectus-2026-27-p2.webp)

## Page 3: Learning beyond borders

The IB continuum, student pathways into the programme, our international community, and what studying in Bratislava opens up for students.

![Prospectus page 3: building an IB continuum, student pathways into the IB programmes, and the school's location in Bratislava](/images/news/prospectus-2026-27-p3.webp)

## Page 4: History, heritage and alumni

The story of the school building on Česká Street, its place as a protected historic landmark, and the alumni connected with it.

![Prospectus page 4: the history and heritage of the school building and its notable alumni](/images/news/prospectus-2026-27-p4.webp)

If you would like to know more about applying, please contact the DP Coordinator and we will be glad to talk you through the programme.
